ਨਾ ਨੂੰ ਵੇਖਣ ਨਹੀਂ ਦੇਣਗੇ ॥੬੨॥"}}},{"verse_id":98267,"page_no":558,"line_no":98267,"gurmukhi":"ਨਹੀ ਏਕ ਮੰਤ੍ਰਹਿ ਜਾਪ ਹੈ ॥","translit_en":"nahee ek ma(n)treh jaap hai ||","translation":{"pu":{"ss":"(ਕਿਸੇ) ਇਕ ਮੰਤ੍ਰ ਨੂੰ ਨਹੀਂ ਜੱਪਣਗੇ।"}}},{"verse_id":98268,"page_no":558,"line_no":98268,"gurmukhi":"ਦਿਨ ਦ੍ਵੈਕ ਥਾਪਨ ਥਾਪ ਹੈ ॥੬੩॥","translit_en":"dhin dhavaik thaapan thaap hai ||63||","translation":{"en":{"bdb":"No advice or mantra will be followed for more than one two days.63."},"pu":{"ss":"(ਨਵੇਾਂ ਮਤ ਦੀ) ਦੋ ਇਕ ਦਿਨਾ ਲਈ ਸਥਾਪਨਾ ਕਰਨਗੇ ॥੬੩॥"}}}],"nav":{"prev":9186,"next":9188}}